{"c":[{"name":"20261005T031924Z-459c6ef9ec89ae5d","text":"D2-02: Router 1 answers within ~0.05 of its 0.5 floor flip between live corpus runs (m02 0.52/0.49, m09 0.45/0.51); diff runs per moment before crediting a code change with a recall move.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261005T032639Z-5905894b0fafbfcc","text":"B27: a failed fill reaches the user only through Helper.fillFailed (planner/says.ts fillSays); its window and field ids go to warn. Early exits that called this.error published ids until afadd34.","type":"note"}]}
